  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“C’mon, boy, wanna play a game of fetch the fireball?”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Must possess an animal companion with the bounding blast class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When your animal companion imbues you with a blast through its bounding blast ability, you can deliver that blast within a number of rounds equal to your animal companion’s Constitution modifier.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You must deliver a blast imbued to you by the bounding blast ability by the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess a kinetic blast, you gain the bounding blast class feature. This functions the same as the bestial kineticist archetype’s bounding blast, except you imbue your animal companion with a kinetic blast you possess instead and it can use that blast within a number of rounds equal to your Constitution modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
